SUMMARY:All-day panigiri of the Dormition\, Akamatra
LOCATION:Akamatra\, Ikaria\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Akamatra\, the pretty mountain village above Evdilos\, runs an all-day 15 August panigiri in its central square organised by the association 'I Kefala': violins from 13:00 (two different ensembles in 2026\, Panagiotis Choutras and Nikos Kochylas) through to the following morning. It is the sensible choice if Langada sounds like too much: paved road\, a real square\, food all day. Karavostamo\, Gialiskari\, Kouniadoi\, Monokampi\, Kampa\, Perdiki and Panagia all celebrate the same day.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#akamatra-all-day-panigiri-of-the-dormition-akamatra
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/ikaria/#akamatra-all-day-panigiri-of-the-dormition-akamatra
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
